      <name>Angela Tiatia, Vaiola, 2026</name>
      <description><![CDATA[<b>Angela Tiatia, Vaiola, 2026</b><br><i>Arts &amp; Culture</i><br>Fri 22nd May – Sat 13th Jun<br>Museum of Contemporary Art Australia, The Rocks<br>Free<br><br>Sāmoan-Australian artist Angela Tiatia's light projection Vaiola debuts on the MCA facade. The work combines two of her films, exploring migration and belonging through Pacific cultures and cinematic storytelling.<br><br><a href="https://www.therocks.com/whats-on/events/angela-tiatia,-vaiola,-2026">More info / tickets</a>]]></description>
